Array _ NCPolynomialRing -- create a word from an array
*******************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        w = a_R
  * Inputs:
      * a, an *note array: (Macaulay2Doc)Array,, In the form [i_1,...i_k] where
        0 < i_j< d+1, where d is the number of generators of R;
      * R, an instance of the type *note NCPolynomialRing:
        (NCAlgebra)NCPolynomialRing,,
  * Outputs:
      * w, an instance of the type *note NCRingElement:
        (NCAlgebra)NCRingElement,, The element of R corresponding to
        R_(i_1)*...R_(i_k);

Description
===========

This method allows to create a monomial in a free associative algebra $R$. It
follows the same convention of *note wordFormat: wordFormat,. Let $Lt_1,\dots,
Lt_d$ be the generators of $R$, then an array of integers $[i_1,\dots, i_k]$
such that $0<i_l<d+1, \forall 1\leq l\leq k$ yields the element $$Lt_{i_1}
Lt_{i_2}\cdot\dots\cdot Lt_{i_{k-1}} Lt_{i_k}$$ of $R$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : d = 5;                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = wordAlgebra(d); -- create a free associative algebra over Lt_1,..., |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Lt_d                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : a = new Array from for i from 1 to d list i; -- The array [1,...,d]     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : f = a_R  -- The word associated to a                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = Lt Lt Lt Lt Lt                                                          |
|       1  2  3  4  5                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : g = product gens R -- The word Lt_1*...Lt_d                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = Lt Lt Lt Lt Lt                                                          |
|       1  2  3  4  5                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : f === product gens R                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note wordAlgebra: wordAlgebra, -- create a free algebra over a given
    alphabet
  * *note wordFormat: wordFormat, -- display a tensor in word notation

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note Array _ NCPolynomialRing: Array _us NCPolynomialRing, -- create a
    word from an array
