concatPath -- concatenation of paths
************************************

  * Usage: 
        concatPath(X,Y)
        X**Y

Description
===========

This allows for concatenation of paths. The concatenation is formal, no
parametrization is chosen.

+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[t];                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : X = polyPath({t,t^2}) ** polyPath({t^3 + 3*t, t^2 - 1})|
|                                                            |
|o2 = Path in 2-dimensional space with 2 polynomial segments:|
|                                                            |
|           2     3        2                                 |
|     {{t, t }, {t  + 3t, t }}                               |
|                                                            |
|o2 : Path                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------+

